{{!
    @template local_reportium/aihelp

    Contents of the AI help panel of the SQL Inspector when the site has no AI provider: the instructions file of the
    report to copy or download. Rendered from JavaScript (local_reportium/aihelp).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - Heading
    * text - What the file is for
    * admintext - HTML from a language string for site administrators (how to set up an AI provider), or empty
    * copy - Label of the copy button
    * download - Label of the download button
    * usesql - How to use the SQL the AI writes
    * example - Example question, or empty

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Write SQL with AI",
        "text": "Copy the instructions file of this report into any AI chat.",
        "admintext": "",
        "copy": "Copy",
        "download": "Download",
        "usesql": "Paste the SQL it writes in the editor.",
        "example": "Courses with more than 10 participants"
    }
}}
<div class="reportium-sqlchat-header"><i class="fa fa-magic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <div><strong>{{title}}</strong></div></div>
<p class="reportium-aihelp-text">{{text}}</p>
{{#admintext}}<p class="reportium-aihelp-admin small">{{{admintext}}}</p>{{/admintext}}
<div class="reportium-aihelp-actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" data-action="ai-help-copy">
        <i class="fa fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{copy}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" data-action="ai-help-download">
        <i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{download}}</button>
</div>
<p class="small text-muted mb-1">{{usesql}}</p>
{{#example}}
<p class="small mb-0 reportium-aihelp-example">
    <i class="fa fa-lightbulb-o fa-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{example}}</p>
{{/example}}
<div class="small text-success" data-region="ai-help-status" role="status"></div>
